msgid "Enable the widget"
msgstr "Widget aktivieren"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:557
msgid ""
"Turn this off to pause the WordPress embed without changing your DocsBot bot."
msgstr ""
"Deaktivieren Sie diese Option, um die WordPress-Einbettung zu pausieren, "
"ohne Ihren DocsBot-Bot zu ändern."

