#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:565
msgid "Never show on URL prefixes"
msgstr "Bei diesen URL-Präfixen niemals anzeigen"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:567
msgid "Exclusions always win over inclusions."
msgstr "Ausschlüsse haben immer Vorrang vor Einschlüssen."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:573
msgid "Audience"
msgstr "Zielgruppe"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:574
msgid "Only show to logged-in WordPress users"
msgstr "Nur angemeldeten WordPress-Benutzern anzeigen"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:576
msgid "Allowed WordPress roles"
msgstr "Zulässige WordPress-Rollen"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:577
msgid "Leave every role unchecked to allow all roles."
msgstr "Lassen Sie alle Rollen deaktiviert, um sämtliche Rollen zuzulassen."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:585
msgid "Membership integration"
msgstr "Mitgliedschaftsintegration"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:587
msgid "Plan, product, or role IDs"
msgstr "Tarif-, Produkt- oder Rollen-IDs"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:589
msgid ""
"Comma-separated. Leave empty for any active membership; Ultimate Member "
"requires role slugs."
msgstr ""
"Kommagetrennt. Für jede aktive Mitgliedschaft leer lassen; Ultimate Member "
"erfordert Rollen-Slugs."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:593
msgid ""
"The selected membership integration is not currently available. The widget "
"will fail closed until it is active."
msgstr ""
"Die ausgewählte Mitgliedschaftsintegration ist derzeit nicht verfügbar. Das "
"Widget verweigert den Zugriff, bis die Integration wieder aktiv ist."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:598
msgid "Conversation identity"
msgstr "Unterhaltungsidentität"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:599
msgid ""
"Sharing identity makes DocsBot conversations non-anonymous. Each field is "
"optional and is sent only after the visitor passes your access rules."
msgstr ""
"Durch das Teilen der Identität sind DocsBot-Unterhaltungen nicht mehr "
"anonym. Jedes Feld ist optional und wird erst gesendet, nachdem der Besucher "
"Ihre Zugriffsregeln erfüllt hat."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:601
msgid "Share display name"
msgstr "Anzeigenamen teilen"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:602
msgid "Share email address"
msgstr "E-Mail-Adresse teilen"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:603
msgid "Share pseudonymous site user ID"
msgstr "Pseudonyme Website-Benutzer-ID teilen"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:605
msgid ""
"Review the suggested DocsBot text under Settings → Privacy before enabling "
"identity fields."
msgstr ""
"Prüfen Sie den vorgeschlagenen DocsBot-Text unter Einstellungen → "
"Datenschutz, bevor Sie Identitätsfelder aktivieren."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:609
msgid "Private bot signing"
msgstr "Signierung privater Bots"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:612
msgid "Private signing is ready"
msgstr "Private Signierung ist eingerichtet"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:612
msgid ""
"The bot signing key was retrieved securely and encrypted on this WordPress "
"server. Visitors receive only short-lived signed tokens."
msgstr ""
"Der Bot-Signaturschlüssel wurde sicher abgerufen und auf diesem WordPress-"
"Server verschlüsselt. Besucher erhalten ausschließlich kurzlebige signierte "
"Tokens."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:614
msgid "Signing key unavailable"
msgstr "Signaturschlüssel nicht verfügbar"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:614
msgid ""
"Reconnect this bot to retrieve its signing key. DocsBot will keep the widget "
"paused until private signing is ready."
msgstr ""
"Verbinden Sie diesen Bot erneut, um seinen Signaturschlüssel abzurufen. "
"DocsBot lässt das Widget pausiert, bis die private Signierung eingerichtet "
"ist."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:617
msgid "Token lifetime (seconds)"
msgstr "Token-Gültigkeitsdauer (Sekunden)"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:621
msgid "The selected bot is public, so no signature key is needed or retained."
msgstr ""
"Der ausgewählte Bot ist öffentlich, daher wird kein Signaturschlüssel "
"benötigt oder gespeichert."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:623
